-- Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2026 (S.I. 2026/148): PART 8, ARTICLE 34 (REVOCATION).
-- Layer 1. Article 34 comes into force on 5th May 2026 (art 1(3)(o)): the date is read from uro-part1-intro, not restated.
-- The Order says nothing about savings or about what the revoked Order did before: those are not encoded.

§ `Article 34 -- Revocation`

-- out of text: nothing; the date is read from art 1(3)(o).
-- src:456 | 34 Revocation
-- src:457 | The Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2025 is revoked.
@ref art 34 (src:456-457)
GIVEN `the date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`art 34: the Social Security Benefits Up-rating Order 2025 has been revoked on the date` `the date` MEANS
    NOT (`the date` LESS THAN `art 1(3)(o): the date on which article 34 comes into force`)
